        "original_id": "ad6e9a3c-a9c0-566d-b390-82622a0285a9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Gray Television, Entravision Communications Corporation\n- TV Stations: KSCW-DT, KWCH-DT, KDCU-DT\n- Networks: CBS, Univision\n- Places: Wichita, Kansas, Hutchinson, Kansas\n- Concepts: duopoly, joint sales agreement\n\nFacts:\n- KWCH-DT is a CBS-affiliated television station serving Wichita, Kansas, and it is licensed to Hutchinson, Kansas.\n- KWCH-DT broadcasts on virtual channel 12 and UHF digital channel 19.\n- Gray Television owns KSCW-DT as part of a duopoly with CBS affiliate KWCH-DT.\n- Gray Television also operates Univision affiliate KDCU-DT on channel 31 under a joint sales agreement with owner Entravision Communications Corporation.",
